'''2nd Round: Dusk (Expert)''' is one of the possible [[Continuation Stage]]s that derives from [[First Round (Expert)]] that is a part of [[The Proving Grounds]]. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[3rd Round: Dawn (Insane)]]
*[[3rd Round: Dusk (Insane)]]

