==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Quite adverse to [[2nd Round: Dawn (Expert)]], this stage is filled to the brim with [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies, and is ironically more similar to [[3rd Round: Dusk (Hard)]] than it is to [[2nd Round: Dawn (Expert)]]. THE SLOTH is the boss, who spawns near instantly, supported by the Dagshunds and Otta-smack-us. If you've beaten [[Thriller Bridge]] before, this should be about the same, but if you have not, use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], as many [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] as you need, along with timing [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] in between [[THE SLOTH]]'s attacks.

